## 5. Infrastructure & Security Analysis

### Tech Stack (Confirmed)
| Component | Technology | Evidence |
|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Frontend | React + Vite SPA | `<div id="root">` + Vite asset hashes |
| Backend | Java Spring Boot | `x-application-context: application:production` |
| Database | SQL (PostgreSQL/MySQL) | Sequential integer IDs, foreign key references |
| Web Server | Nginx (reverse proxy) | HTTP headers |
| Load Balancer | AWS ALB | `AWSALB` cookies |
| Hosting Region | AWS Mumbai (`ap-south-1`) | S3 bucket URLs |
| Student Photos | AWS S3 (pre-signed URLs) | `pceterp.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com` |
| College Logos | AWS S3 (public bucket) | `pccoebucket.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com` |
| Mobile App Assets | AWS S3 (public bucket) | `erpstudentmobileapp.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com` |
| Support Tickets | Freshdesk | `edupluscampus-support.freshdesk.com` |
| QR Codes | External API | `api.qrserver.com` |

### Security Model
| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| Authentication | Session-based cookies |
| Photo Access | Pre-signed S3 URLs (expire in 1 hour) |
| Identity Verification | Encrypted token (`encData` field) |
| Data Isolation | Server-side — session determines which student's data is returned |
| Transport | HTTPS with HSTS (`max-age=31536000`) |
| Frame Protection | `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` |
| Content Sniffing | `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` |

### S3 Buckets Identified (4 total)
1. `pceterp` — Private student photos & exam signatures (pre-signed access)
2. `pccoebucket` — Public college logos
3. `erpstudentmobileapp` — Public mobile app UI assets
4. `cloud/` prefix — Used for organizing files within `pceterp` bucket

