## 7. Sem 3 Target Strategy

To reach **7.0 CGPA** by end of Semester 3:

```
Current: 267 grade points across 40 credits = 6.67 CGPA
Target:  (267 + X) / (40 + 20) = 7.0
         267 + X = 420
         X = 153
Required Sem 3 SGPA = 153 / 20 = 7.65
```

**Focus Areas:**
- Target **A grades (8 GP)** in high-credit subjects (3-credit courses)
- Maintain strong Lab performance (consistently scoring A/A+)
- Avoid P grades — even one P in a 3-credit subject costs 12 grade points vs 24 for an A

